  "common_mistakes_ka": "• ❌ do a mistake → ✅ make a mistake\n• ❌ make homework → ✅ do homework\n• ❌ make a photo → ✅ take a photo\n• ❌ strong rain → ✅ heavy rain\n• ❌ big wind → ✅ strong wind\n\n💡 დაიმახსოვრე: MAKE = შექმნა, DO = შესრულება, TAKE = აღება (take a photo, take a break)!",
